# nft-blocklist allowlist — one IP or CIDR per line, "#" comments.
# Entries here are NEVER blocked: they are subtracted from every feed and
# an accept rule for them runs before any drop rule. If an allowlisted IP
# shows up in a feed you get an allowlist_collision notification instead of
# an outage.
#
# Put here: your monitoring probes, office/home IPs, upstream resolvers,
# anything whose loss of access would lock you out.

# 203.0.113.10        # office
# 198.51.100.0/28     # monitoring provider
